    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.poster.avif?t=1726326387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.webm?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.mp4?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In a distant future humans will enhance themselves with robotic paraphernalia to make their lives longer, or just to be stronger. Our hero Cybergeist did that, but to survive. He got cheated, and now he is a living weapon of mass destruction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/e88a9ee6b222971ae72af0370d659927.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>The cops of all the city are hunting down Cybergeist. Their goal: kill. So run and dodge them all over the endless highway.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/4c9da33901caa60f05d75d96a43192cf.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>Collect the Burst Spheres until our hero gets full charged to activate the Burst Mode. In this mode Cybergeist is able to destroy everything on his path!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/49123df2bfd6a84f86cd6962978b88e7.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.poster.avif?t=1726326387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.webm?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.mp4?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cybergeist is a twist on the classic game with the yellow hero afraid of ghosts. Referencing other classics in the process.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/dcb75cad69adb8c3885681a78a34ddfc.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>Neon lights, big banners, terrible life. Cybergeist gets it all. A dark, and yet colorful, dystopic future.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/a9dd1117cd0924ff2fe6f78be6fdde14.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>The game features great electronic beats from Peritune. A catchy sound that makes you thrill over the highway.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.poster.avif?t=1726326387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.webm?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/9683523ddc6b166ccb82e6d4aef361fe.mp4?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In a distant future humans will enhance themselves with robotic paraphernalia to make their lives longer, or just to be stronger. Our hero Cybergeist did that, but to survive. He got cheated, and now he is a living weapon of mass destruction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/e88a9ee6b222971ae72af0370d659927.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>The cops of all the city are hunting down Cybergeist. Their goal: kill. So run and dodge them all over the endless highway.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/4c9da33901caa60f05d75d96a43192cf.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>Collect the Burst Spheres until our hero gets full charged to activate the Burst Mode. In this mode Cybergeist is able to destroy everything on his path!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/49123df2bfd6a84f86cd6962978b88e7.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.poster.avif?t=1726326387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.webm?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/66b27b9c3fae90119321e70184d14ad3.mp4?t=1726326387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cybergeist is a twist on the classic game with the yellow hero afraid of ghosts. Referencing other classics in the process.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/dcb75cad69adb8c3885681a78a34ddfc.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>Neon lights, big banners, terrible life. Cybergeist gets it all. A dark, and yet colorful, dystopic future.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457820/extras/a9dd1117cd0924ff2fe6f78be6fdde14.webp?t=1726326387\" /></div><br><br>The game features great electronic beats from Peritune. A catchy sound that makes you thrill over the highway.",
